                    description: Some("A list of Feature names and types. Name and Type is compulsory per Feature.  Valid feature FeatureTypes are Integral, Fractional and String.  FeatureNames cannot be any of the following: is_deleted, write_time, api_invocation_time  You can create up to 2,500 FeatureDefinitions per FeatureGroup"),
                    takes_value: true,
                    arguments: [
