                    ],
                    description: Some("The maximum number of parallel requests that can be sent to each instance in a transform job. If MaxConcurrentTransforms is set to 0 or left unset, Amazon SageMaker checks the optional execution-parameters to determine the settings for your chosen algorithm. If the execution-parameters endpoint is not enabled, the default value is 1. For more information on execution-parameters, see How Containers Serve Requests. For built-in algorithms, you don\'t need to set a value for MaxConcurrentTransforms"),
                    takes_value: true,
